{"id":270456,"title":"期中考试 | 这些编译原理知识，你都掌握了吗？","content":"<p>你好，我是宫文学。</p><p>到这里，我们的课程就已经更新一半了，今天，我们来进行一场期中考试。我出了一套测试题，共有5道判断题、5道多选题，满分100，核心考点都出自前面的“预备知识”模块和“真实编译器解析”模块。</p><p>我建议你来认真地做一下这套题目，检验一下自己的学习效果。答完题之后，你也可以回顾试卷的内容，对不太理解或答错的问题，进行深入思考和学习。如果有不明白的，欢迎随时在留言区提问，我会知无不言。还等什么？一起来做下这套题吧！</p><p><a href=\"http://time.geekbang.org/quiz/intro?act_id=202&exam_id=539\"><img src=\"./images/270456_1.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p><!-- [[[read_end]]] -->","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":241218,"user_name":"易昊","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1018968,"ip_address":"","ucode":"CD7A8CD9427C21","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/8c/58/abb7bfe3.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1597217933,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":90563,"content":"温故知新，好！","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"宫文学Richard","uid":1543380,"ctime":1599373194,"ip_address":"","comment_id":241218,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100052801,"comment_content":"第一遍单选题全对，多选题错了不少，等有大块的时间把这几个知识点好好总结一下","like_count":2,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1543380,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/17/8c/d4/327a8616.jpg","nickname":"宫文学","note":"","ucode":"09EADF0CB62C91","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":503676,"discussion_content":"温故知新，好！","content_length":7,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1599373194,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":342087,"user_name":"TableBear","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1673990,"ip_address":"","ucode":"A2C0562EEA2725","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/19/